# Build context is the repository root.  Leave out git history, editor and
# Python/Rust caches, and anything built on the host (it's for a different OS:
# the image rebuilds everything from source).  Submodules have a `.git` file
# pointing into the top-level .git; without either, the build skips the
# submodule refresh.
**/.git
.idea
.venv
target
**/__pycache__
**/*.dSYM
**/*.o
**/*.a
**/*.so
**/*.dylib
external/build-*
config.vars
compile_commands.json
# Not needed in the image; editing the scripts shouldn't rebuild Lightning.
contrib/liquid-poc
